Condition : 30 - The school cycle storage shall be made available for use in accordance with the following provisions:
-	71 spaces, including 45 pupil spaces, 15 staff spaces (within a separate, segregated enclosure from pupil spaces) and 11 short-term spaces upon first occupation;
-	60 additional spaces provided when 90% of the initial pupil cycle parking spaces have been utilised (i.e. 41 of the 45 pupil cycle spaces);
-	27 additional spaces provided at 90% of the provided pupil cycle parking spaces being utilised (i.e. 95 of the 105 pupil cycle spaces)
The storage shall be provided as indicated on the approved plans, consisting of horizontal storage arrangements to ensure accessibility for all users and where double stack arrangements, these shall be provided with a mechanical or pneumatic assisted lift (or such equivalent provision). The cycle stores shall then be maintained as such thereafter.
